{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dante's 9 is a roguelite action-platformer fused with a deckbuilder, where you use powerful cards to augment your combat abilities. You are Dante the cat, and you must sacrifice your nine lives on your journey through the depths of the underworld. Can you reach the 9th circle before its too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/dantes9_gif_cards.gif?t=1749000684\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a uniquely powerful deck each run to slay the monsters of the underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/dantes9_gif_sword.gif?t=1749000684\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through the nine circles of Hell with real-time card-based combat, combined with action platforming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedural levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/dantes9_gif_explore.gif?t=1749000684\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse nine hellish environments and conquer unique challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique boss cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meta-progression between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Unique biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meow button</p></li><